# =============================================================================
# pycalphad 官方示例 2.4（下）：Equilibrium Properties and Partial Ordering
# 对应文档：examples/4_EquilibriumWithOrdering
#
# 官方还展示了直接读有序相的各占位分数（site fraction）。
# 宏里写成 PROPERTY SITEFRACTION(相)：该相每个亚点阵占位符一条曲线。
# =============================================================================

OPEN database/NI_AL_DUPIN_2001.TDB
ELEMENTS AL NI
PHASES LIQUID FCC_A1 FCC_L12 BCC_A2 BCC_B2

PROPERTY SITEFRACTION(FCC_L12) VS T FROM 300 TO 1500 STEP 5 X(AL)=0.25
EXPORT FIGURE output/10_site_fractions_fcc_l12.png
EXPORT DATA output/10_site_fractions_fcc_l12.csv
